Installation

Clone the repository:

git clone https://github.com/yourusername/advanced-port-scanner.git
cd advanced-port-scanner

Create a virtual environment and activate it:

python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate

Install dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt
Usage

Scan common ports:

python main.py scanme.nmap.org

Scan a custom range:

python main.py 127.0.0.1 -p 1-1024

Scan specific ports:

python main.py localhost -p 22,80,443,8080

Set thread count and timeout:

python main.py example.com -p 1-1000 -t 200 --timeout 1.0

Export results:

python main.py scanme.nmap.org -p 1-1000 --json output/results.json
